  "description": "GemBox.Spreadsheet is a .NET component that enables you to read, write, convert, and print spreadsheet files (XLSX, XLS, XLSB, CSV, HTML, and ODS) from .NET applications.\n      With GemBox.Spreadsheet you get a fast and reliable component that's easy to use and doesn't depend on Microsoft Excel. It requires only .NET and it's much faster than Microsoft Office Automation!",
