  "releaseNotes": "Added support for NORM.S.DIST and ERF functions.\nFixed issue with NORMSDIST function implementation for higher input values.\nFixed issue with invalid row index in XLSX reader.\nFixed issue with array formulas not being recalculated in XLSX files.\nFixed issue with evaluating XLOOKUP formula that should return range of values.\nFixed issue with currency number format in ODS writer.\nAdded support for PdfSaveOptions.FontSettings, ImageSaveOptions.FontSettings, and XpsSaveOptions.FontSettings.\nImproved font fallback selection.",
